了商离天那么多，他最后居然剜我的心，灭我九族；你师父救我，也只不过是希望我去替他的女儿报仇，他们有人性吗？个个都拿我当棋子，用完及弃，我告诉你，我媚儿决不会再做任何人的棋子！”凌风忽然沉默了，因为，他也知道师父救她的目的，虽然他很同情媚儿的遭遇，可是，毕竟这死的人是他的师父。见他不语，媚儿接着说：“你以为，他收你为徒就是对你好吗？事实是怎样，你比我更清楚，如果你要替他报仇，我奉陪到底！”凌风是有武功，可是，刚才在里面的时候，媚儿已知道，以他的武功绝不是她的对手，相反，倒是那个站在一旁不动声色的小仙，似乎有些古怪。“你呢？你也要替这个老头报仇吗？”见小仙一直怔怔地站在一旁，媚儿问道。无悔老人死了，小仙的脸上并没有一丝难过，反而有一种解脱的神情，听了媚儿的话，她摇摇头，淡淡地说：“我不会为他报仇！”媚儿虽然不知道小仙跟无悔老人之间有什么恩怨，不过，至少，现在，少了小仙这个对手，于是，清了清嗓子，道：“我杀了老头，你们两人现在有两个选择，一是杀了我，你们离开；二是，我杀了你们，我离开！”这个破谷，她可是一点儿都不留恋。凌风放下无悔老人的尸体，缓缓地站起来，下意识地站到了小仙的身旁，两人互望了一眼，像是在交流着什么。“怎么？做个决定很难吗？”媚儿只想速战速决，然后离开这里。凌风答道：“我们还可以有第三个选择。”媚儿柳眉微挑：“第三个选择？”一时没想明白他们要做什么。只见凌风与小仙二人扑通一声朝着媚儿跪了下来：“我们愿意跟随在小姐身边，任凭小姐差遣！”“你们要跟着我？”媚儿想过几种可能，可就偏偏没有想到这个。“小姐不用怀疑我们的忠心，这是师父研究出来忠心丸，我们一人一颗服下，他日我们若是对您有二心，定会毒发身亡！”凌风说完，将手中红色的药丸递给小仙，一人一颗，没有丝毫犹豫就吞了下去。媚儿想阻止可是却已经来不及：“其实你们不用这样，你们想跟着我，我没说不可以，不过，我现在连自己要去哪里都不知道，怎么能带上你们呢？”小仙与凌风互望一眼，异口同声的答道：“小姐！我们知道您现在应该去哪里！”", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/dizhenhuanzhizuidufeifei/7.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "The Most Poisonous Wasted Concubine: \"You, you actually killed the master!\" Ling Feng held the dead old man Wuhui with one hand and pointed at Meier with the other and asked tremblingly. Meier's chin raised and her charming eyes turned cold: \"He deserves to die! So he deserves to be killed! What? Do you want to avenge him?\" Murder is just a common occurrence for her, nothing to make a fuss about. \"Master saved you! You actually killed him! You are so inhumane!\" Ling Feng accused her heartbrokenly. Meier snorted coldly and said with hatred: \"Human nature? You actually talk to me about human nature! I helped Shang Litian so much, but in the end he actually cut out my heart and destroyed my nine tribes. Your master only saved me because he wanted me to avenge his daughter. Do they have human nature? All of them have Use me as a chess piece, use it up and throw it away. I tell you, I, Meier, will never be anyone else's chess piece again!\" Ling Feng suddenly fell silent, because he also knew the purpose of his master's rescue of her. Although he sympathized with Mei'er's experience, after all, the person who died was his master. Seeing that he was silent, Mei'er continued: \"Do you think that he is doing you good by accepting you as his disciple? The truth is, you know better than me. If you want to avenge him, I will accompany him to the end!\" Ling Feng has martial arts, but when she was inside just now, Mei'er already knew that with his martial arts he was no match for her. On the contrary, the little fairy standing aside calmly seemed a little weird. \"What about you? Do you also want to avenge this old man?\" Meier asked when she saw Xiaoxian standing aside in a daze. The old man Wuhui died, and there was no trace of sadness on Xiaoxian's face. Instead, there was a look of relief. After listening to Meier's words, she shook her head and said lightly: \"I will not avenge him!\" Although Meier didn't know what grudges there were between Xiaoxian and the old man Wuhui, but as of now Shao, now, Xiaoxian is no longer an opponent, so she cleared her throat and said: \"I killed the old man, and you two have two choices now. One is to kill me, and you leave; the other is, I kill you, and I leave!\" She didn't miss this Pogu at all. Lingfeng put down the body of old man Wuhui, stood up slowly, and subconsciously stood next to Xiaoxian. The two looked at each other, as if they were communicating. \"What? Is it difficult to make a decision?\" Meier just wanted to make a quick decision and leave here. Ling Feng replied: \"We can also have a third option.\" Meier raised her eyebrows slightly: \"The third option?\" For a moment, she didn't understand what they were going to do. Ling Feng and Xiaoxian knelt down towards Mei'er with a plop: \"We are willing to follow the young lady and do whatever she wants!\" \"You want to follow me?\" Mei'er thought of several possibilities, but she never thought of this. \"Miss, there is no need to doubt our loyalty. This is the loyalty pill developed by Master. Each of us takes one pill. If we have second thoughts about you in the future, we will be poisoned and die!\" After Ling Feng finished speaking, he handed the red pill in his hand to Xiaoxian. Each of us swallowed one pill without any hesitation. Meier wanted to stop her but it was too late: \"Actually, you don't have to do this. If you want to follow me, I didn't say you can't. However, I don't even know where I'm going now, so how can I take you with me?\" Xiaoxian and Lingfeng looked at each other and replied in unison: \"Miss! We know where you should go now!\"", "title_en": "Chapter 7"}